{"resourceIdentifier":"4423","resourceName":"NEW HOPE AWMS GHG Mitigation Project In Anhui Province","description":"NEW HOPE AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Anhui Province (hereinafter referred to as the Project) introduces 3 new animal waste management systems (AWMSs) to treat the manure from 3 existing swine farms in Bengbu City, Anhui Province, which are owned by WUHE NEW HOPE LIUHE ANIMAL HUSBANDRY Co. LTD (hereinafter called the project owner). Each subsidiary swine farm will install one AWMS. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons.\r\nThe specific treatment process of these AWMSs are as follows: All the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, part of the organic fertilizers are distributed to local farmers for free, the rest will be sold in the local market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured for heat generation, with surplus biogas destroyed through flaring systems (if any). The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around for free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nIt is estimated that approximately 1216.08*104 m3 of biogas will be produced annually. The biogas will be captured and utilized for heat generation, the heat will be only used for the daily operation of the AWMSs and the 3 swine farms and will not be produced to other users. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from heat generation are neglected.","location":{"latitude":32.984926,"longitude":117.663510},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-06-26","endExclusive":"2023-07-27","endInclusive":"2023-07-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4423"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Anhui"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4423"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"126761"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/01/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/08/2021 - 31/07/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=89531&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df123463249","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_New Hope Anhui Province_20230426_draft.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-05-05T06:16:58.303Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=89530&IDKEY=9903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfs123461870","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-05-05T06:16:12.203Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=94709&IDKEY=d097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87n130603711","documentType":"Registration Representation","document